# Shader conventions

- Always specify a Fallback shader for compatibility
- Use properties block for all tweakable values
- Name properties with underscore prefix: _MainTex, _Color, _Metallic
- Use HLSLPROGRAM / ENDHLSL blocks, not the deprecated CGPROGRAM / ENDCG
- Include SRP Batcher compatibility: use CBUFFER_START(UnityPerMaterial) for properties in URP/HDRP
- Minimize shader variants: use shader_feature_local over multi_compile when possible
- Use half precision where full float is unnecessary (mobile especially)
- Tag SubShaders with RenderPipeline tag: "UniversalPipeline" or "HDRenderPipeline"
- Use Render Graph compatible custom passes instead of extra cameras
- Test shaders on target platforms early; mobile GPUs behave differently
- Document complex math with comments
- Prefer Shader Graph for artist-facing shaders; use HLSL for performance-critical shaders
- Use Custom Function nodes with header guards (#ifndef) to inject HLSL into Shader Graph
